  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Arrange the four graphs in descending order of total work done; where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are the work done corresponding to figure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> respectively.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0079_6a01f9c9a7b5.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 139px;\" /><img src=\"assets\\qt0079_cbf40ab3a46c.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 136px;\" /><img src=\"assets\\qt0079_4cd494128548.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 131px;\" /><img src=\"assets\\qt0079_1e9e3b9eaf1a.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 127px;\" /></p>"
  },
