  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As seen from figure, work done in first graph,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Now, work done in figure&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math>, and that in figure&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></math>.</p><p>In last graph, work done is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></math>.</p><p>So, the descending order of total work done is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p>"
